message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Multi-Class Disease Detection & Early-Warning Anomaly Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  Production MLOps pipeline that predicts 8-class diabetes / heart disease /
  hypertension comorbidity sublabels from routine biomarkers with a
  leakage-free, cost-sensitive LightGBM model, and scores deviation from a
  healthy baseline with IsolationForest and One-Class SVM detectors.
